        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Everything in <strong>ASHOR</strong> begins from nothing. You step into the world as a naked rookie warrior and fight for survival in the heart of the wild. Chop trees, break stones, hunt wild animals, gather reeds near the water, or purchase what you need from the marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the materials you collect, you craft your own equipment, forge stronger weapons and armor, and shape your destiny with your own hands. As you grow stronger, you challenge dangerous fortresses and face powerful bosses, using the valuable loot they drop to create even more epic gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step brings you closer to the top — because in <strong>ASHOR</strong>, the ultimate goal is to reach the highest floor of the arena and rule over it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather. Craft. Grow Strong. Conquer.<br>Only the most determined warriors can rule in ASHOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/b91c6f0aa7b7753965861f046a47a501.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/b91c6f0aa7b7753965861f046a47a501.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/b91c6f0aa7b7753965861f046a47a501.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c7ec380285abf0fe31067ebf4b27bf27.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Everything in <strong>ASHOR</strong> begins from nothing. You step into the world as a naked rookie warrior and fight for survival in the heart of the wild. Chop trees, break stones, hunt wild animals, gather reeds near the water, or purchase what you need from the marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/c5c6a8c93b25e38d8455ceea486452c5.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the materials you collect, you craft your own equipment, forge stronger weapons and armor, and shape your destiny with your own hands. As you grow stronger, you challenge dangerous fortresses and face powerful bosses, using the valuable loot they drop to create even more epic gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/7daef342c9f462c26e9a8d85c99d8f94.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step brings you closer to the top — because in <strong>ASHOR</strong>, the ultimate goal is to reach the highest floor of the arena and rule over it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.poster.avif?t=1768604436\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.webm?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/850a3a6d5de2388e81f3eafb83203d9f.mp4?t=1768604436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather. Craft. Grow Strong. Conquer.<br>Only the most determined warriors can rule in ASHOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188720/extras/b91c6f0aa7b7753965861f046a47a501.poster